1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
This is a sample subtitle file.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Point subs at it to see a translation
written right next to it.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Only the text you are reading gets translated.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,000
The numbering and timestamps stay exactly the same.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Pick a language, press Return, and watch it go.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,000
That is the whole app.
